    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. okay, so no aged stuff. but what about other things? i seen people say that fermented foods like kimchi or miso are super healthy for gut health and mood. since they arent \"cheese\" or \"meat\" are those okay to add to my diet? i really want to make sure i'm getting all the best nutrients while i'm on this med.",
