      "content": "Fermented foods like kimchi and miso can sometimes contain tyramine, so you must check the specific ingredients and how they were made. Some fermented soy products might be restricted, so it is safer to avoid them until cleared by your doctor. Discuss specific fermented foods with your prescribing physician to ensure they fit within your MAOI restrictions. They can give you personalized advice on safe gut-healthy additions to your diet.",
